WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.310 --> 00:00:02.390
Yeah, I'm not quite sure what to add.

2
00:00:02.510 --> 00:00:06.170
Certainly, in my memories of him,
it's what everybody's been saying:

3
00:00:06.170 --> 00:00:09.890
drinking Black Label, coming from the airport
with a couple bottles

4
00:00:09.890 --> 00:00:11.870
sitting out on our porch,

5
00:00:12.170 --> 00:00:19.070
having an ashtray accumulate cigarettes
at a staggering pace.

6
00:00:21.010 --> 00:00:22.770
Yeah, he was such a character.

7
00:00:22.990 --> 00:00:26.470
I think we're all using very similar words
to describe our memories of him.

8
00:00:28.510 --> 00:00:32.410
Only maybe net new is, I feel like
he was kind of frozen in time.

9
00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:35.810
Like that picture Mom shared from the '80s,
from the early '80s.

10
00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:40.730
That's my image of him from the '90s,
from the 2000s and the 2010s.

11
00:00:40.730 --> 00:00:45.650
I don't know if the Black Label just cured him
and he was just preserved.

12
00:00:45.650 --> 00:00:50.690
He was pickled for the last 30, 40 years.

13
00:00:52.210 --> 00:00:58.490
Yeah, no, just so full of love and laughter
and just really a bon vivant.
